0 \u0627\u0644\u0652\u062d\u064e\u0643\u0650\u064a\u0652\u0645\u0650\u06d9","indoText":"Dan Allah tidak menjadikannya (pemberian bala-bantuan itu) melainkan sebagai kabar gembira bagi (kemenangan)mu, dan agar hatimu tenang karenanya. Dan tidak ada kemenangan itu, selain dari Allah Yang Mahaperkasa, Mahabijaksana.","enText":"And Allah made it not except as [a sign of] good tidings for you and to reassure your hearts thereby. And victory is not except from Allah, the Exalted in Might, the Wise -","readText":"wa m\u0101 ja'alahull\u0101hu ill\u0101 busyr\u0101 lakum wa lita\u1e6dma`inna qul\u1ee5bukum bih, wa man-na\u1e63ru ill\u0101 min 'indill\u0101hil-'az\u012bzil-\u1e25ak\u012bm","audio":"https:\/\/everyayah.com\/data\/Alafasy_64kbps\/003126.mp3","juz":4,"manzil":1,"page":66,"ruku":54,"hizbQuarter":26,"sajda":false},{"verseId":127,"ayahText":"\u0644\u0650\u064a\u064e\u0642\u0652\u0637\u064e\u0639\u064e \u0637\u064e\u0631\u064e\u0641\u064b\u0627 \u0645\u0650\u0651\u0646\u064e \u0627\u0644\u0651\u064e\u0630\u0650\u064a\u0652\u0646\u064e \u0643\u064e\u0641\u064e\u0631\u064f\u0648\u0652\u0653\u0627 \u0627\u064e\u0648\u0652 \u064a\u064e\u0643\u0652\u0628\u0650\u062a\u064e\u0647\u064f\u0645\u0652 \u0641\u064e\u064a\u064e\u0646\u0652\u0642\u064e\u0644\u0650\u0628\u064f\u0648\u0652\u0627 \u062e\u064e\u0627\u06e4\u0649\u0655\u0650\u0628\u0650\u064a\u0652\u0646\u064e","indoText":"(Allah menolong kamu dalam perang Badar dan memberi bantuan) adalah untuk membinasakan segolongan orang kafir, atau untuk menjadikan mereka hina, sehingga mereka kembali tanpa memperoleh apa pun.","enText":"That He might cut down a section of the disbelievers or suppress them so that they turn back disappointed.","readText":"liyaq\u1e6da'a \u1e6darafam minalla\u017c\u012bna kafar\u016b au yakbitahum fa yangqalib\u1ee5 kh\u0101`ib\u012bn","audio":"https:\/\/everyayah.com\/data\/Alafasy_64kbps\/003127.mp3","juz":4,"manzil":1,"page":66,"ruku":54,"hizbQuarter":26,"sajda":false},{"verseId":128,"ayahText"